# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# Generated screenshots and serial captures (tools/screenshot)
shots/
*.ppm

# Generated ABI conformance output (tools/abi); CI publishes it to the wiki
docs/compat/*
# ...except the hand-written real-hardware evidence (docs/compat/hardware.md,
# docs/compat/<machine>/; real-pc-boot-plan.md, kabylake-box-plan.md)
!docs/compat/hardware.md
!docs/compat/kabylake/
!docs/compat/amd-nuc/

# A static BusyBox binary is a fetched/built artifact (issue #254), never
# committed; `tools/abi/busybox.py` rebuilds it, the image embeds it.
tools/abi/busybox

# Generated kernel test report (tools/test)
docs/test/

# Python bytecode caches (tools)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
